WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.552
Drop Net, or AI Hawk, is the draft step of the JobNet pipeline, as a demo you can try.

2
00:00:06.502 --> 00:00:12.103
Paste a vacancy, generate a draft, review it, and copy it out.

3
00:00:12.103 --> 00:00:17.284
You get a tailored cover note and a CV synopsis, drafted in your browser.

4
00:00:17.284 --> 00:00:20.000
It runs locally from templates.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.988
There is no model call, no scrape, and nothing is stored or sent.

6
00:00:24.988 --> 00:00:28.618
The sample vacancies are fictional and employer-free.

7
00:00:28.618 --> 00:00:36.490
The real pipeline runs as scheduled routines off this host, and its sanitised shortlist is browsable read-only on JobNet.

8
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:43.570
It is the same human-gated loop as JobNet: draft only, never auto-send, never auto-apply.
